# This is an EXUDYN example
#
# Details:  Symbolic user functions: Notebook `python/Notebooks/tutorialSymbolic.ipynb`. A nonlinear oscillator:
#           a mass point on a Cartesian spring-damper whose force is a user function, written once in Python and
#           turned into a symbolic user function, which runs much faster. The outputs below each cell are those
#           of the last run.
